//RS         // `begin`/`commit`/`rollback`/`close` — is an INSTANCE method dispatched
//RS         // by the receiver's `DBConnection` type (see `check_db_connection_method`
//RS         // below), not a second module-call surface. There is no raw-string
//RS         // `execute(sql)` escape (D-DBDRIVER1's build plan: "must not expose a
//RS         // generic `execute_raw(sql)` escape").
